{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","无双厉斩"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","無双斬"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","瑟恩进入无敌状态连续斩击敌人，结束时引爆剑痕造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","無敵状態になり、敵に斬撃を複数回繰り出す。斬撃終了時に剣痕を爆発させ、敵に範囲ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","瑟恩进入无敌状态，对战场上的随机敌人进行8段斩击，斩击造成210% + 25% ATK伤害并在目标身上留下“剑痕”，斩击结束时瑟恩会引爆全部“剑痕”，对周围1格敌人造成200% + 20% ATK真实伤害，同一敌人连续受到“剑痕”伤害时，后续伤害降低50%。瑟恩每完成一次切磋，斩击段数额外增加2段。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","斬撃を8回繰り出す。1回ごとに、フィールド上のランダムな敵1体に210% + 25% ATKのダメージを与え、「剣痕」を付与。斬撃終了時にすべての「剣痕」を爆発させ、半径1マス以内の敵に200% + 20% ATKの確定ダメージを与える。1回の「無双斬」で同じ敵が「剣痕」によるダメージを複数回受けた場合、2回目以降の剣痕ダメージ-50%。手合わせを1回完遂するたびに、斬撃の回数+2。スキル発動中、自身は無敵状態になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":88,"end":94,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":97,"end":103,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":4,"end":6,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":84,"end":98,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":93,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":203,"end":205,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","斩击伤害提升至220% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","斬撃1回ごとのダメージが220% + 25% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","斩击伤害提升至230% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","斬撃1回ごとのダメージが230% + 25% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","斩击伤害提升至240% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","斬撃1回ごとのダメージが240% + 25% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","斩击伤害提升至250% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","斬撃1回ごとのダメージが250% + 25% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","瞬身剑"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","瞬身剣"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","瑟恩与敌方英雄切磋，完成切磋后获得强化。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵英雄と手合わせを行い、手合わせ完遂後に自身を強化"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始后，瑟恩依次闪现至自身当前列、左列和右列最靠后的敌方英雄身边并与其切磋。每次切磋持续4秒，期间双方优先攻击对方，且无法使用普通攻击以外的技能。切磋结束时，若瑟恩的生命值不低于20%则视为完成切磋，恢复50% + 5%最大生命并永久提高12% + 1.5%基础属性。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、「自身がいる列」「左の列」「右の列」の最も後ろにいる敵英雄の近くに順番に瞬間移動し、対象と手合わせをする。手合わせは1回ごとに4秒間続き、その間、セインと対象の敵は優先的に互いを攻撃し、両者とも通常攻撃しか行えなくなる。手合わせ終了時、セインのHPが20%以上の場合、手合わせ完遂と見なされ、セインのHPがHP上限×50% + 5%分回復し、基本ステータスが永続的に+12% + 1.5%"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":107,"end":112,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":124,"end":131,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":167,"end":172,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":193,"end":200,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","完成切磋时，永久提高13% + 1.5%基础属性。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","手合わせ完遂後の基本ステータス上昇量が13% + 1.5%にUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","完成切磋时，永久提高14% + 1.5%基础属性。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","手合わせ完遂後の基本ステータス上昇量が14% + 1.5%にUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","完成切磋时，永久提高15% + 1.5%基础属性。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","手合わせ完遂後の基本ステータス上昇量が15% + 1.5%にUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","纵横斩"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","縦横斬"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","瑟恩斩出多道剑气，开始切磋时刷新冷却。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","方向を変えながら斬撃を複数回繰り出す。手合わせ開始時にCDをリセット"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","瑟恩对目标进行3次不同方向的直线斩击，每次对目标所在的3格直线范围内的敌人造成120% + 15% ATK伤害。本技能视为普通攻击，且每次进行切磋时，立即刷新本技能冷却。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵1体に向けて、方向を変えながら斬撃を3回繰り出す。斬撃1回につき、長さ3マスの直線範囲内の敵に120% + 15% ATKのダメージを与える。このスキルは通常攻撃と見なされ、手合わせを開始するたびにCDがリセットされる"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至130% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが130% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至140% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが140% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが150% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提高攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、攻撃速度UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升15点攻击速度，完成1次切磋后，额外提升9点攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃速度+15。初めて手合わせを完遂すると、追加で自身の攻撃速度+9"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升20点攻击速度，完成1次切磋后，额外提升12点攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃速度+20。初めて手合わせを完遂すると、追加で自身の攻撃速度+12"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升25点攻击速度，完成1次切磋后，额外提升15点攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃速度+25。初めて手合わせを完遂すると、追加で自身の攻撃速度+15"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","剑影回刃"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","幻影の刃"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低受到的伤害，受到非普攻伤害时反击敌人。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","被ダメージDOWN。通常攻撃以外のダメージを受ける時、敵に反撃する"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","瑟恩受到来自敌人的非普攻伤害降低40%。当其将要受到非普攻伤害时，会生成一道幻影对伤害来源发起反击，造成160% ATK伤害，每名敌人每3秒至多触发1次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃以外の被ダメージ-40%。通常攻撃以外のダメージを受ける時、幻影を1体生成。幻影は攻撃者に反撃して160% ATKのダメージを与える。この効果は同じ敵に対して3秒ごとに1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","幻影斩击造成的伤害提升至180% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","幻影のダメージが180% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","瑟恩每完成一次切磋，释放纵横斩时额外生成一道幻影对目标发起穿梭斩造成180% ATK伤害，且所有幻影造成的伤害额外附带100% ATK真实伤害。累计完成3次切磋后，纵横斩造成的伤害必定暴击，每点暴击额外提升1点暴击伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","縦横斬発動時、完遂した手合わせの回数と同じ数の幻影を生成する。各幻影は対象に貫通斬を繰り出し、180% ATKのダメージを与える。幻影によるすべての攻撃（反撃を含む）に100% ATKの確定ダメージを追加。手合わせを3回完遂すると、縦横斬によるダメージが必ずクリティカルになり、クリティカル1Ptにつき、縦横斬のクリティカルダメージ+1"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":59,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":47,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":84,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","幻影斩击造成的伤害提升至200% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","幻影のダメージが200% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","攻击后洞悉目标弱点，提升对其造成的伤害并降低来自其的伤害。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","攻撃した敵を観察し、対象への与ダメージUP、対象からの被ダメージDOWN"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","瑟恩洞悉攻击过的目标，使自身对该目标造成的伤害提升25%，受到来自该目标的伤害降低25%，持续15秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","攻撃した敵を観察し、15秒間、対象への与ダメージ+25%、対象からの被ダメージ-25%（重複不可、再度観察すると持続時間がリセットされる）"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","凛志者"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","凛然たる意志"]]}